  message: "Line index optimization merged in PR #2366. 47% improvement on killbill (30s→16s). Remaining Flink scaling issue is driven by name resolution (separate from dataflow), which would need a different optimization (e.g., prefix tree or hash-based resolver). Flink's 14K files with deep class hierarchies push name resolution to super-linear complexity. This is a known limitation for extremely large Java monorepos."  # 1294
